.git
.github
node_modules
# Nested deps too — `node_modules` alone only matches the top level, so the
# vendored Deck app's own install (vendor/bento/slides/node_modules, ~80MB) was
# being shipped into the build context. The image installs deps in its own
# `deps` stage; nothing here is ever needed from the context.
**/node_modules
# Deck build intermediates. The shell that IS served is public/deck/index.html
# (committed) — these are the throwaway steps that produce it.
vendor/**/dist
vendor/**/dist-single
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.next
.env
.env.*
npm-debug.log
README.md
docs/
scripts/
